                <p class="pov__subtitle">
                    From Meir to more. Antwerp is partly known for it’s fashion
                    and the Fashionista knows this. Always on the lookout for
                    unique styles and trends. They are inspired by Antwerp’s
                    fashion culture and creative atmosphere. Time for you to see
                    Antwerp through stylish eyes.
