            <div class="container povroute__content">
                <h3 class="POV__title">The Main Character</h3>
                <p class="pov__subtitle">
                    People from Antwerp are arrogant, this is the most known
                    stereotype in Belgium. The main character walks through the
                    city as if they own it, always knowing the best route, the
                    best café, and the best view. They simply believe their city
                    deserves the spotlight, and it does! So go discover Antwerp
                    through their eyes.
                </p>
